{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-ocean-star","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"ocean-star-mina-rashid-emaar","about":"Discover the serene elegance of Ocean Star, situated in the heart of Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina. This EMAAR Ocean Star development seamlessly merges the serene allure of waterfront living with the dynamic essence of Dubai. Offering a diverse array of residences, Ocean Star caters to every lifestyle.  Select from 1 to 3 Bedroom Apartments, ensuring a life of unparalleled luxury and convenience. Embrace daily luxury at Ocean Star, where every moment is an indulgence in the finer aspects of life, surrounded by sophisticated architecture that blends traditional elegance with contemporary flair.Living at Ocean Star within EMAAR Ocean Star apartments means more than just enjoying a beautiful home; it means being part of a lifestyle that epitomizes tranquility and luxury. Positioned within Rashid Yachts &amp; Marina, the development offers a unique living experience, combining the tranquility of marina life with the vibrancy of Dubai. The convenience of an on-site health clinic and proximity to educational facilities enhances your living experience, ensuring everything you need is within easy reach. Ocean Star stands as a testament to Dubai's visionary approach, offering a lifestyle that's both opulent and serene, perfectly balanced between nature and urban living.","price":1700000,"title":"Ocean Star","bitrix":{"id":396,"pf_id":"are.2.13676","source":null,"project_id":"Ocean Star","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Ocean Star","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Mina Rashid"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/oceanstar_feature_255ef032b9.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/oceanstar_feature_255ef032b9.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.25485